# Storage tree: bulk-ignored (raw IQ, per-run canonical burst/window
# records under 01_inputs/canonical_records/ -- 100-250MB per paper run) but
# the LIGHT canonical scientific-results reports the paper cites (2026-08-18,
# DEVELOPMENT EVIDENCE closure, see docs/ble/PAPER_EVIDENCE_MAP.md) must stay
# versioned: 06_statistics/*.json (RQ1/RQ2/coverage_analysis/sensitivity
# reports, ~170KB across every real run) and paper_exports/ (CSV/figures,
# ~800KB). `*` (not a trailing `/`) at each level, never a bare directory
# pattern, so git still walks in and evaluates the negations below --
# excluding a directory with a trailing `/` stops git from ever looking
# inside it again, which would make re-including anything below impossible.
backend/app/infrastructure/persistence/storage/*
!backend/app/infrastructure/persistence/storage/scientific_reports
backend/app/infrastructure/persistence/storage/scientific_reports/*
!backend/app/infrastructure/persistence/storage/scientific_reports/ble
backend/app/infrastructure/persistence/storage/scientific_reports/ble/*
!backend/app/infrastructure/persistence/storage/scientific_reports/ble/paper_exports
!backend/app/infrastructure/persistence/storage/scientific_reports/ble/paper-run-*
backend/app/infrastructure/persistence/storage/scientific_reports/ble/paper-run-*/*
!backend/app/infrastructure/persistence/storage/scientific_reports/ble/paper-run-*/06_statistics
!backend/app/infrastructure/persistence/storage/scientific_reports/ble/paper-run-*/run.json
backend/app/modules/rf_signal_understanding/models/mlp_spectral_classifier/model.npz
backend/app/modules/rf_signal_understanding/models/mlp_spectral_classifier/metadata.json



backend.venv-validation/
